WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.140
Vinnie and Wayan left the racing field.

2
00:00:05.141 --> 00:00:10.085
They tied the oxen to a tree and walked up the mountain.

3
00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:12.366
"Where are we going?"

4
00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:15.576
Vinnie asked as they went higher.

5
00:00:15.577 --> 00:00:19.450
"To my favorite spot," said Wayan.

6
00:00:19.451 --> 00:00:22.248
The boys stopped to rest.

7
00:00:22.249 --> 00:00:26.179
"Wow!" Vinnie gasped.

8
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.820
"I can see everything from up here!"

9
00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:34.184
He was looking down at the village and ocean.

10
00:00:34.185 --> 00:00:37.306
Wayan laughed.

11
00:00:37.307 --> 00:00:44.847
"From here, everything—the mountains, the sea, the village—looks connected.

12
00:00:44.848 --> 00:00:51.946
In Bali, everything we build and do is based on this idea of connection," he said.

13
00:00:51.947 --> 00:00:55.733
"I don’t understand," said Vinnie.

14
00:00:55.734 --> 00:01:02.210
"To be happy, people should live in harmony with nature, the gods, and each other.

15
00:01:02.211 --> 00:01:10.659
My father says that harmony with those three things is necessary for a good life," continued Wayan.

16
00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:15.645
Back at the village, the adults were ready to hold their meeting.

17
00:01:15.646 --> 00:01:19.592
"Mandy, come home with me," said Nyoman.

18
00:01:19.593 --> 00:01:22.509
"We can get ready for the festival."

19
00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:27.636
"Sure," replied Mandy, walking with her new friend.

20
00:01:27.637 --> 00:01:33.008
The homes reminded Mandy of the courtyard houses she had seen in China.

21
00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:42.268
Nyoman pointed out that every family had separate areas for different activities.

22
00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:45.640
"We sleep and eat in different places.

23
00:01:45.641 --> 00:01:49.985
There’s also a building for ceremonies and a guest house.

24
00:01:49.986 --> 00:01:53.172
The wall is to keep out evil forces."

25
00:01:53.173 --> 00:01:56.933
Then Nyoman asked, "Are you hungry?"

26
00:01:56.934 --> 00:02:00.157
"Yes," said Mandy.

27
00:02:00.158 --> 00:02:04.679
Suddenly Nyoman climbed up a tall tree.

28
00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:09.415
"Watch your head!" she called, and she dropped a coconut.

29
00:02:09.416 --> 00:02:11.408
It broke in half.

30
00:02:11.409 --> 00:02:16.589
Nyoman climbed down, and the girls shared the delicious fruit.

31
00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:21.848
"I love climbing trees," giggled Nyoman.

32
00:02:21.849 --> 00:02:25.169
"Can I try?" asked Mandy.

33
00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:33.007
Nyoman led her to a smaller tree with green bananas and said, "Climb this one."

34
00:02:33.008 --> 00:02:38.532
Mandy was about to climb when she heard loud screeching.

35
00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:44.680
A few monkeys scrambled down a tree and started chasing the girls.

36
00:02:44.681 --> 00:02:52.807
Laughing, Nyoman and Mandy ran until they reached the rice field behind Nyoman’s house.

37
00:02:52.808 --> 00:02:57.316
There Mandy noticed a miniature house on a pole.

38
00:02:57.317 --> 00:03:01.075
Grains of rice were sprinkled inside.

39
00:03:01.076 --> 00:03:04.547
"What is this?" she asked.

40
00:03:04.548 --> 00:03:09.012
"A rice field temple," explained Nyoman.

41
00:03:09.013 --> 00:03:12.888
"Rice farmers give rice grains to the Rice Mother.

42
00:03:12.889 --> 00:03:16.349
She is the most loved goddess in Bali."

43
00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:19.665
"Wow," said Mandy.

44
00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:23.315
"There are a lot of temples in Bali!"

45
00:03:23.316 --> 00:03:25.718
"Every family has one.

46
00:03:25.719 --> 00:03:29.804
Every village has one too," said Nyoman.

47
00:03:29.805 --> 00:03:32.899
"There are mountain temples and river temples . . .

48
00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:37.293
Bali is called the island of a thousand temples."

49
00:03:37.294 --> 00:03:43.004
Back on the mountain, Vinnie and Wayan were ready to return to the village.

50
00:03:43.005 --> 00:03:46.721
Suddenly Vinnie felt the ground shake.

51
00:03:46.722 --> 00:03:51.357
"Whoa! What’s that?" he shouted.

52
00:03:51.358 --> 00:03:55.273
A low sound rumbled like thunder.

53
00:03:55.274 --> 00:04:00.084
"The mountain is not happy," said Wayan worriedly.

54
00:04:00.085 --> 00:04:03.512
"What do you mean?" asked Vinnie.

55
00:04:03.513 --> 00:04:08.203
"The god who lives in the mountain is upset," said Wayan.

56
00:04:08.204 --> 00:04:10.965
The ground shook harder.

57
00:04:10.966 --> 00:04:17.939
"Let’s get out of here!" shouted Vinnie.

